yandex-messenger-native (2.162.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Auth dialog: non-blocking OAuth callback
    - Replaced blocking recv_timeout with spawn_callback_listener +
      try_recv polled from the GTK main loop (no more 120 s UI freeze).
    - Timeout extended to 180 s.
    - Primary CTA shows inline Spinner + status while browser flow runs.
    - Implicit-grant fragment (access_token) captured via HTML bridge
      (/token POST) — previously fragments never reached the server.
    - Branded success page replaces plain-text "OK" response.
  * Auth dialog: simplified UI
    - Manual token entry moved under an Expander; single primary CTA.
    - "Продолжить" stays disabled until a token is pasted.
    - show_auth_dialog + session_auth_flow unified via finalize_token.
  * Auth CSS: premium polish
    - Gradient brand button (#FFCC00 → #FF8A00) with layered shadow,
      inset highlight, hover/active/disabled states.
    - Radial brand glow behind the auth window.
    - 3 px focus ring on .auth-entry.
    - New .auth-logo, .auth-status, .auth-expander classes.
  * Fixed: removed stale Runtime::new() calls in auth_dialog.rs that
    panicked inside #[tokio::main]. Dialog now takes a shared
    tokio::runtime::Handle; AuthDialog::new in main.rs updated.

 -- BeZoom <bezoom@example.com>  Sun, 10 May 2026 12:40:00 +0300

yandex-messenger-native (2.161.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sprint 9: Search & Performance
    - Search within chat (highlight matches)
    - Global search (Ctrl+K shortcut)
    - Virtualization chat list (gtk::ListView)
    - Lazy loading media
    - Message caching (L1/L2)
  * Sprint 10: Polish & UX
    - Emoji picker (FlowBox with 10+ emojis)
    - Typing indicator (enhanced, debounced)
    - Online status (real-time WebSocket)
    - Reply & Edit (inline)
    - Message actions (copy, delete, forward, save, pin)
    - Undo delete/undo send (5s timeout)
    - Pin messages
  * Sprint 11: Advanced features
    - Thread management (create, navigate, switch)
    - Chat groups / channels
    - Bot support
    - Message scheduling
    - Saved messages
    - Drag-to-reorder chats (fixed)
  * Sprint 12: Enterprise & Accessibility
    - Multi-account support (Account model, AuthManager, AccountDropdown UI)
    - Drag-to-reorder fix (selection.selected() instead of Y-coordinate)
    - High DPI support (CSS classes .hidpi-2x)
    - Accessibility (AccessibleRole for ListView, main container, search)
  * Fixed: 25+ compilation errors across Sprint 10-12
  * Updated Cargo.toml version to 2.161.0

